  "details": "During the community meetup, when someone is explaining their world with everyone gathered around them, they often crash. \nThese players have all been in vr. Three of these crashes have also involved a voice override.\nCommunity meetup events tend to have 40 to 60 players. I noticed that when I was speaking to a large group, my network traffic increased to the point that my stream almost died. Link to my stream when this happened:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uZz2tpF9BCU&feature=youtu.be&t=890",
